pass0: Serial Number LR8602750000102347N0
pass0: 40.000MB/s transfers (20.000MHz, offset 15, 16bit), Tagged Queueing Enabled
darkalpha# camcontrol inquiry pass1
pass1: <IBM DMVS09V 02B0> Fixed Direct Access SCSI-3 device
